{#- Advance Scene: what an overall story intention override is, and how it is written (creator.advance-scene) -#}
The overall story intention override for {{ target_name }} is the story's direction as seen or intended from the point of view of {{ target_name }}. It is used in place of the overall story intention in the prompts written for {{ target_name }}.

It should be written as a forward-looking statement of where the story is heading as far as {{ target_name }} knows, not as a summary of what has happened.
